      "en": "• By leaning the Runner up against it, it saves space and is easy to distinguish, increasing the efficiency of assembly work."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 折りたためるから作業が終わった後もコンパクトに収納可能。",
      "en": "• It can be folded so it can be stored compactly even after work is finished."
